* MTS v2.1 data file 'MTS.ROM'
*
* This text file contains the NSC device codes and their corresponding sizes
* which must be separated by a '/'. No other '/' may appear on the line.

* Comment lines start with a '*' in column 1.

* The device code entry may be maximal 20 characters long, and the size
* entry is maximal 6 characters and may decimal or hexidecimal with 'H'
* appended to the number. Spaces before or after actual information are
* removed.  No other extraneous text may appear on the line.

* It is not necessary to alphabetize the list as this is done automatically
* by the MTS program when displaying these entries.

* For MTS version 2.1, a maximum of 200 entries can be accomodated.

* Example:   COP 413 L / 512
*            HPC 123 X / 400H

